## Hints

- E1: work in σ=1 units — t = cumsum(x)/√(1..n); 10,000 × 7,560 is
  one array; running mean via cumsum, running t via cumsum/ (σ√n).
- E2: for each path, t at months 12, 13, ..., 60 (trailing 252d);
  "some ≥ threshold" per path.
- E4: to hold unconditional σ at 1% with states (σ_lo, σ_hi, p):
  solve p·σ_hi² + (1−p)·σ_lo² = 1e−4.
